WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
The service lessor also initiates a transaction with you.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,600
Replace the old crafting table with three slightly watered fuel oils

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,950
Wouldn't it be a lucky person to be taken advantage of?

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:09,450
I gave you five extra servings of bread.

5
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:12,250
In the future, when you receive location materials, please ask me first if you want to receive them.

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,350
Boss Dugu, don’t worry

7
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,960
Understand

8
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,160
The crafting table is damaged

9
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,060
Automatic repair requires iron wire to be 8

10
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,060
The wire is 1

11
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,360
Rubber is 2

12
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,860
There are wires and rubber in the backpack but one wire is missing.

13
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,660
Thanks to Mr. Dugu for eating some bread

14
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,360
Finally feel alive again

15
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,560
I really don’t want to butcher my body.

16
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,460
I met two boxes in three whole days

17
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,460
Not a bite to eat

18
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,760
They're all useless junk.

19
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,960
Who had the wires on the way when I almost starved to death? Mr. Si Liu

20
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,660
Can you tell me what the wire is used for? I have it.

21
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:38,760
But I don’t dare to change it

22
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,780
Boss, are we entering the electrical age?

23
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,380
I'm still drilling wood to make fire.

24
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,580
Replace the wire with one and sell the bread
